# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Merl understands questions better
- *"Cat variants"* or *"what wolf variants are there"* gets the list of all of them, not one random variant
- *"Graveyard katters"* finds the Katters Structures page, not pages that only mention it, and *"does katters structures work with terralith"* finds the right page too
- Summon commands, block counts and structure file lists no longer crowd out real answers, unless you ask about commands or blocks
- More words understood: *"die"* means death, *"move enchantments"* means transferring them, *"name tag tricks"*, *"last longer"*, *"break"* (durability)
- Words like *"didn't"* or *"wasn't"* no longer make Merl unsure, so *"the resource pack didn't load"* gets an answer
- The short answer at the top uses those words too: *"how do I move enchantments?"* now says *"Transfers enchantments from the item in the Offhand…"*
- *"Anyone online?"* or *"is anybody on?"* shows who's on the server
- Questions about an *"item"* don't get the Minecraft Wiki page about dropped items anymore

## Fixes
- A few of Merl's lines about Peanut Butter and about being hurt could show *"{user}"* instead of your name
- Faster path search for the guide
